      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you meant to check the checksum against calChecksum?\nI would also suggest to add a message as an int comparison failure in the test logs is not very informative:\n```\nassertEquals(checksum, calChecksum, \"wrong v4 checksum\")\n```",
